<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to FixFlow</title>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f4f7fb;
        color: #334155;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      h2 {
        color: #2563eb;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #94a3b8;
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Welcome to FixFlow, <%= name %>! 🎉</h2>

      <p>
        Thanks for joining <strong>FixFlow</strong>. Your account has been
        created successfully.
      </p>

      <p>
        FixFlow helps you easily manage and request professional field
        services.
      </p>

      <p>
        You can now create service requests, track their progress, and connect
        with skilled technicians—all in one place.
      </p>

      <p>
        We're excited to have you with us!
      </p>

      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= year %> FixFlow. All rights reserved.
        <br />
        Simplifying your field service experience.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>